From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 10:34:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add servo barrier control for entry/exit gates

- Firmware: 2 servos (D5 entry, D6 exit), SERVOIN:/SERVOOUT: OPEN[:ms]/CLOSE commands,
  non-blocking auto-close timer
- hardware/rfid.py: format_servo_command + send_servo
- config: SERVO_ENABLED, SERVO_OPEN_SECONDS
- UI: open barrier only when a car is accepted (entry saved / exit closed)
- Tests + README
